te a group, use the mouse to click on the scale. Then press continue to proceed to the next round.<br><br/>\\n             <u>Take these ratings seriously, as they will be used to determine a bonus payment.</u>  <br>\\n             At the end of the study, we will randomly select a pair of these groups and compare your similarity ratings for them.  <br>\\n             If you correctly identify the more similarly liked group (based on prior participants’ liking ratings), then you will receive a fixed bonus payment of $2. <br>\\n             Use the right end of the scale for the most similarly liked groups and the left end of the scale for the least similarly liked groups.<br/>\\n             <br><br/>\\n\\n             When you are ready, press the  <b>SPACEBAR</b> to start.</font>  </div>\", \"response\": \" \", \"trial_type\": \"html-keyboard-response\", \"trial_index\": 334, \"time_elapsed\": 685860, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-10.0-1.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S3_022\", \"subject_age\": \"23\", \"subject_gender\": \"male\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S3_022\", \"browser_name\": \"Chrome\", \"browser_type\": \"114.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1536, \"windowHight\": 792}, {\"rt\": 7916, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_average_strength_42.jpg\", \"slider_start\": [72], \"response\": 23, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"trial_type\": \"image-slider-response\", \"trial_index\": 335, \"time_elapsed\": 694281, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-10.0-2.0-0.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S3_022\", \"subject_age\": \"23\", \"subject_gender\": \"male\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S3_022\", \"browser_name\": \"Chrome\", \"browser_type\": \"114.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1536, \"windowHight\": 792}, {\"rt\": 4528, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_average_strength_45.jpg\", \"slider_start\": [72], \"response\": 65, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"trial_type\": \"image-slider-response\", \"trial_index\": 336, \"time_elapsed\": 698811, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-10.0-2.0-1.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S3_022\